<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 15, 2003 :: Sontalak gives the gnomer a talisman</div><P>Had a lot of folks away, so decided not to run up and see if Yelinak was awake and did Sont quick instead. Messy, but dead. Grats Xman on your talisman!</P>
<P>Bored, so had to try it. Vahnel, Dyanna, Baxis and Shatta killed Nagafen. <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/naggyteam.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 14, 2003 :: Sleeper's Tomb Revisited</div><P>Headed back into ST and managed to get 6 more Ancient Prismatic weapons. Grats Reide on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Lance.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Lance</A>, Vorne and Colwn on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Axe.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Axes</A>, Kithik on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/AncientPrismaticBattlehammer.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Battlehammer</A>, Raihndance on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Stiletto.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Stiletto</A> and Antroe on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Staff.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Staff</A>! Wonderous also got some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Velium_Fraught_Shackles.jpg">Velium Fraught Shackles</A> and tons of quest crap nobody wanted, lots of premier weapons got looted or rotted, Divan&nbsp;saved one of those <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16078">Furious Shrouds&nbsp;of Unlife</A> from rotting and Mahrsan got a nifty <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sightlessveliumeye.jpg">Sightless Velium Eye</A>. </P>
<P>We wound our way down to the Final Arbiter, killing all sorts of various mobs that popped as we killed, making Wonder giddy with quest items to fill up the bank. I even took a couple pictures. </P>
<P>Wonderslippers!<BR><IMG alt="Dainty Blue Slippers!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stwondshoes.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Master of the Guard<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stmotg.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>The Final Arbiter<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stfinal.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><IMG alt=Bwahaha! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stks.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Before heading to Sleeper's Tomb, we tried to get a rezz stick for emergencies, but Vox was cheap. Vahnel (51 warrior), Fahrgus (51 paladin), Baxis (51 monk), Dyanna (52 druid) and Shatta (49 cleric) killed Vox with Vaea and Bearspirit (sorta). <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/voxteam.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>And earlier in the day, Dyanna got the seahorse and completed her epic. <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dyannaepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 13, 2003 :: Little pre-dragon Bug Killing</div><P>Thanks to Raihn keeping her vigilant bugwatch, we got to head on down and squash the bug again! Grats Talyss on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/BileCoatedCodex.gif">Bile Coated Codex</A> and Meeka on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Strands_of_Power.jpg">Strands of Power</A> and Colwn got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13332">Orb</A>. </P>
<P>Inny wasn't up, so Antroe ran around and found that Klandicar was still up and waiting for us. Grats Jenrenee on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">talisman</A> and Leviathaun on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/PeerlessDragonhideBreastplate.JPG">new breastplate</A>! </P>
<P>Some leveling grats!<BR>Grats Juhel on 60 and High Priestess!<BR>Grats Yimish on 59!<BR>Grats Garrich on 55 and Animist!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 51 and Vicar!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 46!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 21, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 12, 2003 :: The secret is out!</div><P align=center><IMG alt="Ain't no big thing!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/nibbler/quote1.gif" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Nibbler</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 11, 2003 :: Grats Mys on your 10th Ring!</div><P>And thanks for letting us have a nice war again. Of course yours was full of mayhem. /smirks</P>
<P>Mys earned her <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Garrich got a nice <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Balut is sporting a new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Fezz got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Tsochi got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, and Mahrsan won the greed roll on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> while Morlith won the greed roll on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 10, 2003 :: Kland and more levels </div><P>Thanks Kithik for spotting Kland and thanks everyone for running out and killing another dragon! Grats Grajin on your talisman!</P>
<P>Grats Lushissx on Muse!<BR>Grats Ladibugg and Grace on 58!<BR>Grats Tearem on 57!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 9, 2003 :: Some levels and a dead guppy</div><P align=center><FONT color=#9900ff size=5>Happy Birthday Davius!!</FONT></P>
<P>Grats Bearspirit on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Bashiuss and Eolh on 61!<BR>Grats Mytee on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 45!</P>
<P>Late at night found Reide and Greylok bored. So after finding Ulump up for Dyanna, we decided it'd be fun to kill Fay with us two and Vaeabot. Too easy. :(</P>
<P><IMG alt=Guppy! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/fay.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 10, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 8, 2003 :: Lord Yelinak Dead!</div><P>Well, our Saturday target was already dead, so we went looking for something else to do and found Yelinak up in his lair. We went up and up and up to bring him down! </P>
<P>Grats Reide on getting some head (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gauntletsodslaying.jpg">Gauntlets of Dragon Slaying</A>), Kantar on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinaks_talisman.JPG">Yelinak's Talisman</A> (cause clerics need 41% haste!), Vorne on a neat toy - <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/soul_defiler.jpg">Soul Defiler</A>, Lairiel saved an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/outriders_taming_whip.jpg">Outrider's Taming Whip</A> from rotting (cause you gotta have whips) and Aridius and Jenrenee each won the greed roll on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/dragonsbloodearring.jpg">Dragon's Blood Earring</A>. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Thanks for the boots!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yel.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yeldead.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P align=center><FONT color=#9966cc size=5>Happy Birthday Lentor!</FONT> /ducks</P>
<P>Grats Eolh on 60 and High Priestess!<BR>Grats Feskan on 64!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 59!<BR>Grats Yimish on 58!<BR>Grats Gargaden on 54!<BR>Grats Arwiin on 49!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=7'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a> <a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a> 8 <a href='news.asp?page=9'>9</a> <a href='news.asp?page=10'>10</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=9'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
